# >>> PrototypeFramework agent-doc sync (PrototypeFramework 0.4.2) — edits inside this block are overwritten by Framework/Agent Docs/Sync (editor) or Tools/Build/pf-build.sh agentdocs.
# Output the framework's Tools/pf/ gates write inside the repo — regenerated on every run, never source.
# UiGate captures differ by GPU and are rewritten by the capture harness; Tools/UiGate/probes/ IS source.
